      en: ["Located in San Pédro, the country's second-most important port city.", "Capacity of 20,000 seats spread over a 23-hectare site.", "Named after Laurent Pokou (1947–2016), a legendary Ivorian striker.", "Officially inaugurated on September 8, 2023.", "Features a high-quality natural grass playing surface.", "Hosted Group F matches during the 2023 Africa Cup of Nations."],
