      en: ["Construction was completed in 1984.", "The building reaches a height of approximately 105 meters.", "Features a total of 26 floors above ground level.", "Originally served as the headquarters for the Ministry of Posts and Telecommunications.", "Stylistically belongs to the architectural modernism of the 1980s.", "Underwent a comprehensive renovation between 2014 and 2017."],
